==Battleground==
*1 [[Gory Dark]] (200%) spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*1 [[Dark Otter]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Gory Dark]] (1%) spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Dark Otter]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**20 [[Gory Dark]]s (200%) spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**2 [[Dark Otter]]s spawn, delay 3.33~4.67 seconds<sup>100f~140f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Standard Black Stage. Bring [[:Category:Anti-Dark Cats|anti-Dark]] Units to subdue the enemies decently quickly. Bring meatshields to prevent them from pushing, and you win.

